    "title": "Service outages reported across the Brazos Valley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adrienne DeMoss ,\n7 hours ago BRYAN, Texas (KBTX) - Widespread internet outages have been reported across the Brazos Valley Wednesday afternoon. Texas A&M University Police said the department’s non-emergency line is currently down “due to being affected by a network outage.” Those unable to reach the TAMU PD at 979-845-2345, can call the backup line at 979-587-6131. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
